---Used to attach graphics for [cursor boxes](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/CursorBoxType.html) to entities during runtime. HighlightBoxEntity can also be independent from entities so it is simply drawn somewhere in the world. See [LuaSurface::create\_entity](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/classes/LuaSurface.html#create_entity) for the available options for type "highlight-box".
---
---The [collision\_box](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/EntityPrototype.html%23collision_box#collision_box) of the highlight box prototype is ignored during runtime, instead the "bounding\_box" given in create\_entity() or the selection box of the target entity is used.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/HighlightBoxEntityPrototype.html)
